# 部署筆記檔：內含正式環境密鑰／示範帳密，絕不可發佈成網頁。
# 這裡與根目錄 .gitignore 是兩道獨立的防線：.gitignore 擋「進不進 git」，
# 這份擋「有沒有被當成網站資產發佈」。兩者都要有。
# Deployment scratch notes holding live secrets / demo credentials. This and
# the root .gitignore are two independent barriers: .gitignore controls what
# enters git, this controls what gets served as a site asset. Keep both.
